# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# IMPORTANT: there is intentionally NO catch-all (`/* /index.html 200`) here.
# The original monolithic site served index.html for every path, which is why
# every URL — papers, coffeehouse, family room — resolved to the same page and
# the real content looked lost. This is a true multi-page site: each file is
# served at its own clean URL, and unknown paths fall through to /404.html.

# Preserve the legacy standalone URL that survived the original rebuild.
/emergent-orchestration   /notes/emergent-orchestration   301
